<title>ISRAEL: Elite Q1 EPS falls to 0.03 shekel.</title>
<headline>Elite Q1 EPS falls to 0.03 shekel.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Elite Industries Ltd.</p>
<p>			(in thousands of shekels except EPS)</p>
<p>				    Q1 97	Q1 96</p>
<p>Revenue			  474,232    599,559</p>
<p>Operating profit		33,710     33,695</p>
<p>Net profit			 1,321     17,103</p>
<p>Earnings per share	     0.03	 0.35</p>
<p>Note: Revenues were lower due to the sale of two European plants in the intervening period and a real increase in the Israeli currency against European currencies.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.39 shekels)</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211 x233</p>
</text>
